rsion note and the README); MP 2.177-44 stands (EC 32 art. 2); 15 later versions to 15.11.2025 replayed and checked against l9656compilado.htm: 3 differences, all explained (a missing space, a missing full stop, the consolidated page cutting art. 32 § 10 short; that paragraph matches Lei 15.233/2025's text word for word, and MP 1.301/2025's wording ends at that conversion); Planalto's editorial pointer in art. 35-B dropped. ADI 1.931: Planalto strikes art. 35-E and 'atuais e' in art. 10 § 2º with only an undated '(Vide ADI nº 1.931)', so per the undated-struck-text rule both are left out of every version and the ruling is not modelled (open item in decisions).
